A||||2||GeeDee86GT||Important Parts??||||5||
Z||000000||GeeDee86GT||11-26-2000||10:34 PM||||My parts car (84 4/4spd) is soon off to the wreckers.  Are there any little things I should keep that  are not available but might be overlooked?  Did I read here that someone was keeping track of dead Fieros via their VIN?  Thanks in advance....<P>Gary<BR>86 SE (finding more rust everyday!)||||reg||5
Z||000001||Cooter||11-26-2000||11:20 PM||||Brake booster/master cylinder, calipers, seat belts, all relays and switches, shifter and cables (if the cables are in decent shape), wiper motor, headlight motors, vent controls, blower motor, if it has a tilt column and it is not flopping- get the column, and a partridge in a pear tree. . . ||||reg||1
Z||000002||RNGCRSH||11-26-2000||11:40 PM||||Strip that sucker bare. every nut, bolt,washer, and basicly any part bolted to the spaceframe that is not damaged. You will kick yourself later if you don't. surprisingly a fiero minus the frame will fit into a very small space once completly disasembled.||||reg||1
